==== case ee26b502b127325e RIGHT JOIN LATERAL naming the left side of its own join
ERROR:  invalid reference to FROM-clause entry for table "b"
LINE 1: SELECT * FROM a, b RIGHT JOIN LATERAL (SELECT b.y) s ON true...
                                                      ^
DETAIL:  The combining JOIN type must be INNER or LEFT for a LATERAL reference.
==== case 0e378483d4801bd5 FULL JOIN LATERAL naming the left side of its own join
ERROR:  invalid reference to FROM-clause entry for table "b"
LINE 1: SELECT * FROM a, b FULL JOIN LATERAL (SELECT a.x, b.y) s ON ...
                                                          ^
DETAIL:  The combining JOIN type must be INNER or LEFT for a LATERAL reference.
==== case 422d03f7e0146508 the ON of a RIGHT JOIN after a comma naming an item before it
ERROR:  invalid reference to FROM-clause entry for table "a"
LINE 1: SELECT * FROM a, b RIGHT JOIN c ON a.x = c.z;
                                           ^
DETAIL:  There is an entry for table "a", but it cannot be referenced from this part of the query.
==== case 8280d4cc932d941a the ON of an inner join after a comma naming an item before it
ERROR:  invalid reference to FROM-clause entry for table "a"
LINE 1: SELECT * FROM a, b JOIN c ON a.x = c.z;
                                     ^
DETAIL:  There is an entry for table "a", but it cannot be referenced from this part of the query.
==== case 5d7c589c223624d9 the ON of a parenthesized join naming an item before it
ERROR:  invalid reference to FROM-clause entry for table "a"
LINE 1: SELECT * FROM a, (b LEFT JOIN c ON c.z = a.x);
                                                 ^
DETAIL:  There is an entry for table "a", but it cannot be referenced from this part of the query.
==== case 2414b330c9746724 the ON of a LATERAL chain after a comma naming an item before it
ERROR:  invalid reference to FROM-clause entry for table "a"
LINE 1: ...OM a, b RIGHT JOIN LATERAL (SELECT a.x AS v) s ON a.x = s.v;
                                                             ^
DETAIL:  There is an entry for table "a", but it cannot be referenced from this part of the query.
